  "notes": "{罰|ばっ}する is a formal verb used primarily in legal, official, and written contexts.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: [person]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{罰|ばっ}する\n\nREGISTER:\nThis is formal/written language. In everyday speech, ⟦{罰|ばつ}→罰：10154_batsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{与|あた}える→与える：01821_ataeru⟧ or ⟦{叱|しか}る→叱る：01202_shikaru⟧ (to scold) are more common.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{罰|ばつ}→罰：10154_batsu⟧: punishment, penalty\n- ⟦{罰金|ばっきん}→罰金：18767_bakkin⟧: fine (monetary penalty)\n- ⟦{罰則|ばっそく}→罰則：27147_bassoku⟧: penal regulations\n- ⟦{処罰|しょばつ}する→処罰：21006_shobatsu⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to punish (formal synonym)\n- ⟦{刑罰|けいばつ}→刑罰：20566_keibatsu⟧: criminal punishment\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{法律|ほうりつ}→法律：01722_houritsu⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{罰|ばっ}する: to punish by law\n- ⟦{厳|きび}しく→厳しい：01125_kibishii⟧{罰|ばっ}する: to punish severely",
